{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"1f013f6426b27f8cb555c22229b6c039f0c3bf25e128f377b49ae37cdbaeeacb","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira reconciliation bridge outbound comment sync","key_entities":["REB-1861","REB-1580","REB-1829","comment_ids","RECONCILER_MARKER","outbound_comments._normalize_comment_body","_TRUNCATION_SUFFIX","adapters/jira/comment_limits.py","cleanup.py","reconcile-bridge.yml","run 32403944666","accountId 712020:6471376f-4e5e-4ed2-8c05-330827bc387e","irongrey-chubby-oxpecker"],"problem_keywords":["duplicate comments","jira data cleanup","bot-authored echoes","comment deduplication","reconcile-bridge defect"],"propositions":["The outbound comment sync posted duplicate bot-authored comments on every hourly reconcile pass due to an inert comment-id dedup map, leaving only a lossy body-membership fallback.","REB-1861 reached Jira's 5000-comment hard cap, blocking new comments with COMMENTS_PER_ISSUE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED.","29,931 duplicate bot-authored comments across 27 issues were deleted using keep-oldest-per-distinct-normalized-body, reducing REB-1861 from 5000 to 79 comments.","Phase 1 deletion verified independently: all 27 backed-up issues retain exactly one copy of each distinct normalized body and zero missing bodies post-deletion.","836 bot-authored comments across three issues (REB-1567, REB-1931, REB-2605) lack the reconciler marker due to 32767-char truncation removing the marker paragraph, deferred to phase 2 behind --include-truncated.","The reconcile-bridge workflow remains paused and was not re-enabled by this cleanup operation."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787367335967030001,"uuid":"236aa0f2-488b-416a-b2cc-b275574d9485"}